# Pinned FMI-LS-Wasm contract

The files in `wit/` and `upstream/LICENSE.txt` are copied verbatim from
`modelica/fmi-ls-wasm` commit
`c1aac17d392bec989fe2d059db3cc57bb7a0fff5` (2026-07-08).

This is an actively developed, non-normative prototype. Rumoca's target is
therefore experimental and makes no standards-conformance claim. CI validates
the exact vendored WIT package and the generated component against this pinned
contract.

## Vendored FMI 3 headers

The C headers in `csrc/` (`fmi3Functions.h`, `fmi3FunctionTypes.h`,
`fmi3PlatformTypes.h`) are copied verbatim from the FMI Standard 3.0.2 release
and are licensed under the 2-Clause BSD License; see `csrc/LICENSE.txt`. The
generated C kernel (`csrc/model.c` and the `csrc/rmc_*.c` units) includes them
through the FMI 3 function-prefix mechanism and is the same kernel the `fmi3`
target renders.
